          "anchor": "mse435-u05-c01-vibe-coding-versus-verified-software",
          "definition": "Trades review time for defect risk; defects surface in production.",
          "term": "vibe coding"
        },
        {
          "anchor": "mse435-u05-c01-vibe-coding-versus-verified-software-p02",
          "definition": "Review plus tests; insurance against production defects.",
          "term": "verification"
        },
        {
          "anchor": "mse435-u05-c01-vibe-coding-versus-verified-software-p17",
          "definition": "L/100 x d_v x f vs L/100 x d_f x f + r.",
          "term": "total cost"
        }
      ],
      "minutes": 4,
      "recall": [
        {
          "anchor": "mse435-u05-c01-vibe-coding-versus-verified-software-p03",
          "answer": "The code appears fast and free; the defects appear later in production, where each costs far more than a review hour. Verification is insurance: pay review cost now or defect cost later.",
          "id": "mse435-u05-c01-vibe-coding-versus-verified-software-r1",
          "question": "Vibe coding or verified software?"
        }
      ],
      "title": "mse435-U05-C01 , vibe coding versus verified software"
